WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.939 --> 00:00:06.460
There is something very appealing and attractive
about not caring.

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:10.050
A disregard for consequence and judgment.

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:16.869
A calm, cool collectedness that sets the individual
free.

00:00:16.869 --> 00:00:23.200
The truth is, it’s not realistic, nor is
it healthy or practical to not care at all

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.640
about anything.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:33.280
We are all wired to care about things in order
to survive and connect to life.

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:38.089
Even those who appear to not care at all,
still care.

00:00:38.089 --> 00:00:45.390
But there is, however, a certain amount of
not caring that is realistic, healthy, and

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:46.500
practical.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:53.510
A way to frame your perspective so that you
care about the right things the right amount.

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.579
No more, no less.

00:00:55.579 --> 00:00:56.860
That is the goal.

00:00:56.860 --> 00:01:00.430
To care, but not too much.

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:07.370
We should care about our self, our passions,
our loved ones, and life in general.

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:13.570
Life is inexplicably beautiful and there’s
nothing else to do with it other than squeeze

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:16.050
it for all it is worth.

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:23.380
But yet, at the same time, life is immensely
complicated and uncertain.

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:29.810
And it is fundamentally indifferent to how
much you care about it.

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:35.490
So we should not care too much about life’s
imperfections, including our own.

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:42.530
Or the little things that seem far worse in
the moment but never really end up affecting

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:43.530
anything.

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:51.160
Or the things that go wrong or not as planned,
even when we try our best.

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:54.250
Because no matter how much we try.

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:58.159
No matter how much we want or don’t want
something.

00:01:58.159 --> 00:02:01.920
No matter how fair or unfair.

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:07.380
Life will never go exactly how we always want
it to.

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:14.250
And so, the trick is that we take like serious
enough to still be motivated to participate

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:17.160
in it and appreciate it.

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:22.950
To pursue our passions, goals, and a healthy,
fulfilling life.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:29.950
But not take it so serious that we forget
to admit that failure and imperfection are

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:31.520
inevitable.

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:36.420
That trial and tribulation are synonymous
with life.

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:43.930
To feel the pains of life, but to let things
quickly scab up, heel over and then move on.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:48.590
To refrain from dwelling and picking at the
scab.

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:53.980
To practice forgiveness for the self and forgiveness
for others.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:59.570
To learn and grow from hardship, and come
out on the other side.

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:04.180
Inevitably, life is going to smack you around,
at least a little bit.

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:11.480
You are going to make mistakes, experience
failure and tragedy, receive negative feedback

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:13.290
and so on.

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:19.620
But by taking life a little less serious,
understanding and sympathizing with the idea

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:26.140
that life in the universe is vastly complex
and random, you will not break under such

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:28.290
pressures.

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:34.099
Things might be hard and things might hurt
at times, but they will not break you.

00:03:34.099 --> 00:03:38.050
And better yet, they will build and strengthen
you.

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:41.370
Your are like a muscle in the body.

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:46.970
The more pressure and stress you are able
to withstand without breaking, the stronger

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:50.580
and more powerful you become.

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:56.900
If you can recognize the balance of taking
things seriously, but not too much, you will

00:03:56.900 --> 00:04:01.140
be able to more easily withstand life’s
weight.

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:08.400
You will find yourself becoming more and more
calm, resilient, and ultimately successful.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:15.500
Because those who truly succeed and care about
life, recognize that sometimes caring too

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:43.630
much about life, ruins it.

